      "data": {
        "title": "Deliver Graph-Authored Port and Handle Interfaces",
        "body": "Goal: Deliver Graph-Authored Port and Handle Interfaces\nStatus: in-progress\n\nTasks in scope:\n1. Define the Port endpoint and behavior contract\n2. Build the v1/v2 interface compatibility compiler\n3. Implement Port behavior dispatch and node creation\n4. Implement circular interface geometry and bounded layout\n5. Make Dynamic Port Expansion smoke test pass\n6. Migrate the repository root and authoring guidance\n\nOpen questions:\n1. How should Port interaction behavior be represented?\n2. How should the authored interface frame be projected?",
